###get all clients
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients

###get a client by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/6

###create a new client
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "6",
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Lopez",
  "email": "juan.lopez@example.com",
  "phone": "9999999999"
}

###update an existing client
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/clients/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Julio",
  "lastName": "Perez",
  "email": "julio.perez@example.com",
  "phone": "9999999999"
}

###update only the name of an existing client
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/clients/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "email": "carlos.perez@example.com"
}

###delete a client
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/clients/6